## Sowing

![Three young adults, two women and a man, sitting on a beige couch in a casual setting, engaging in conversation and smiling. There are plants and a coffee table with a mug and notebook in the room.](/images/pages/sowing/cf87a440d3-image-gen--14-.webp)

#### Start strong. Make time your ally.

Sowing sets your foundation: consistent contributions, the right account mix, and a [globally diversified core](/discretionary-management) you can actually stick with. We automate what works, keep decisions simple and repeatable, and align basic protections to real obligations—so you’re building roots while life stays busy.

#### What we focus on

-   Contribution cadence and automation
    
-   Account architecture (TFSA/RRSP/RESP/Corp)
    
-   Global core + disciplined rebalancing
    
-   Emergency fund & “opportunity cash” plan
    
-   Insurance/risk basics tied to liabilities
    

#### Who it’s for

-   Early-career earners and young families
    
-   Late starters rebuilding momentum
    
-   DIY investors ready to formalize a system
    
-   Anyone wanting simple, automated progress
    

